{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "a89354e9-3741-45c1-b3e9-26ac92017be6",
        "name": "05-astro-http-db-turso — Likes",
        "description": "Likes de la tabla Posts (Astro DB + Turso).\n\nColección principal del proyecto. Requiere runtime con Turso (`pnpm dev --remote` o Cloudflare Worker).\n\nGET /api/likes/:id. Si el id existe, devuelve { id, title, likes }. Si no existe, responde 200 con { id, title: \"Post not found\", likes: 0 }.\n\nUsa el entorno Local o Cloudflare. postSlug por defecto es first-post.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "baseUrl",
            "value": "http://localhost:4321"
        },
        {
            "key": "postSlug",
            "value": "first-post"
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "01 — Lectura",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "GET /api/likes/{{postSlug}}",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                                    "pm.test('post con id, title y likes', () => {",
                                    "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                                    "    pm.expect(body.id).to.eql(pm.variables.get('postSlug'));",
                                    "    pm.expect(body.title).to.be.a('string');",
                                    "    pm.expect(body.likes).to.be.a('number');",
                                    "});"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/likes/{{postSlug}}"
                        },
                        "description": "GET /api/likes/:id con un id de la tabla Posts. Respuesta 200: { id, title, likes }."
                    },
